# view_borrow_readonly — read-only view/borrow
# (README §14). Tests borrowing for read-only access.

ViewBorrowReadonly is project
ViewBorrowReadonly module examplesViewBorrowReadonly
ViewBorrowReadonly target console
ViewBorrowReadonly entry main

examplesViewBorrowReadonly is module
examplesViewBorrowReadonly path examples.viewBorrowReadonly
examplesViewBorrowReadonly exports main
examplesViewBorrowReadonly purpose "Demonstrate read-only view/borrow"
examplesViewBorrowReadonly invariant "Read-only borrows are well-formed"

ExitCode is alias
ExitCode for Int32

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout

main is operation
main out ExitCode
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main memory heap no
main async no
main purpose "Use read-only view"
main invariant "Readonly borrow works"

main let shared immutable Int64 88
main let okCode immutable ExitCode 0

main do printShared
main return okCode

printShared is call
printShared in main
printShared invokes console.writeIntegerLine
printShared arg value Int64 shared
